OL,5,G1700 Brother vs Brother
OL,6,     FWith an early lead, Drew
OL,7,     Ftransforms his kitchen from 70s
OL,8,     Fcave to a modern California
OL,9,     Fstunner. Jonathan ups his game and
OL,10,     Ftakes a huge risk with his 'eco
OL,11,     Fchic' kitchen.
